@TaskTrack_HostAddress = http://localhost:5182

###

### 1. Get all tasks
GET {{TaskTrack_HostAddress}}/api/Task
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create a new task
POST {{TaskTrack_HostAddress}}/api/Task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Implement JWT Authentication",
  "description": "Secure API endpoints and configure token-based authentication",
  "IsCompleted": false
}

###

### 3. Get a specific task by ID
GET {{TaskTrack_HostAddress}}/api/Task/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update an existing task
PUT {{TaskTrack_HostAddress}}/api/task/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Implement JWT Authentication - Completed",
  "description": "Successfully secured all endpoints and tested successfully",
  "IsCompleted": true
}

###

### 5. Delete a task by ID
DELETE {{TaskTrack_HostAddress}}/api/Task/1